alwaysApply: false
---

# Feature Components (*-web)

- Keep business logic in hooks/utils/API — components render and handle interaction
- Typed props; prefer discriminated unions for variants
- Server state via React Query; Zustand only for true client global state
- Prefer `@altitutor/ui` + `cn()` / Tailwind; Radix for accessible primitives

## Display consistency (required)

- Subjects/classes: `formatSubjectDisplay`, `formatSubjectShortName`, `formatClassName`, `formatClassShortName` from `shared/utils`
- Badge/status colors: `shared/utils/enum-colors` or `@altitutor/ui` getters — never hardcode badge color classes
